OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AGerman far-right set for big win in
OL,4,Aeastern state - exit polls
OL,5,
OL,6,FNo far-right party has won control of a
OL,7,Fstate in Germany since World War Two,
OL,8,Fand governing at state level would mean
OL,9,Fpowers over policing, local education
OL,10,Fand culture.
OL,12,FSaxony-Anhalt has a small population of
OL,13,F2.1 million and the AfD in the state is
OL,14,Fassessed by domestic intelligence as
OL,15,F"far-right extremist", a classification
OL,16,Frejected by Siegmund.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
